### 로그인

### 1. 정상 로그인 — 예상: 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "shin",
  "password": "police1!"
}

### 2. 잘못된 비밀번호 — 예상: 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "shin",
  "password": "WrongPass123!"
}

### 3. 존재하지 않는 아이디 — 예상: 401
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "unknown_login_user",
  "password": "DemoPass123!"
}

### 4. 비밀번호 누락 — 예상: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "shin",
  "password": ""
}